{
  "Name": "NFR Agent FSFUI Record File Upload RCE",
  "Description": "NFRAgent.exe, a component of Novell File Reporter (NFR), allows remote attackers to upload arbitrary files via a directory traversal while handling requests to /FSF/CMD with FSFUI records with UICMD 130. This module has been tested successfully against NFR Agent 1.0.4.3 (File Reporter 1.0.2) and NFR Agent 1.0.3.22 (File Reporter 1.0.1).",
